# Shell scripts MUST be stored and checked out with LF.
#
# This repository is developed on Windows and run in Linux CI containers. A
# CRLF checkout gives `/usr/bin/env bash: bad interpreter` on the runner --
# a failure that reads like a missing shell rather than a line ending, and one
# that cannot reproduce on the machine that introduced it.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Same reasoning: these are executed or parsed by Linux tooling.
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
